    "created_at": "2015-06-01T11:51:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-06-01T11:51:02Z",
    "body": "I was half expecting push back on this. Won't it be annoying that you can't reuse some existing library code because it uses XHR? From https://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=395931 it sounds like part of the motivation was to get rid of the sync mode, but is that a bigger problem for service workers than other kinds of workers?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
