    "created_at": "2015-06-08T09:12:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-06-08T09:12:32Z",
    "body": "The pain in implementation would be small if we're to keep only async XHR, I guess. Not sure if there're works such that:\n- it makes sense to get the works done in SW, and\n- (part of) the works don't require the Fetch API's functionality, and\n- complicated so that use of library makes sense\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
