    "created_at": "2015-06-09T07:10:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-06-09T07:10:10Z",
    "body": "I was actually expecting us to simply forbid synchronous XMLHttpRequest in SW, but leave it working otherwise. However, since `fetch()` shipped relatively quickly I guess I do not really care either way. If there is some kind of win in not exposing it (or maybe there is one down the line) I would be cool with that.\n\nWhat about `ProgressEvent`?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
