    "created_at": "2015-06-12T03:13:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-06-12T03:13:01Z",
    "body": "I'm sorry that we didn't file a spec bug and link to it from that patch; we should always do that. @slightlyoff is a better person to ask about exposing XHR; @kinu is a better person to ask for implementer feedback from Chromium/Blink.\n",
