    "created_at": "2015-08-14T11:32:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-08-14T11:32:26Z",
    "body": "Only shipping async XHR in SW makes sense to me and I don't feel it's too difficult to implement in Chromium/Blink.  I'm not really sure if exposing XHR is still awaited since SW was shipped without XHR sometime ago and now we have fetch, but having it may make it easier to use JS libraries in SW I guess.\n/cc @mattto\n",
